{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Battles</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles take place on a 5x5 grid. Cards in varying positions and factions interact dynamically, creating a constantly shifting battlefield. Your opponents are meticulously designed computer programs with unparalleled intelligence, and you always have the chance to try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.poster.avif?t=1772952976\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.webm?t=1772952976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.mp4?t=1772952976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.poster.avif?t=1772952976\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.webm?t=1772952976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.mp4?t=1772952976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards with Infinite Potential</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card not only possesses unique skills but also features three sticker slots that can be enhanced with new abilities through stickers. Even the most ordinary card can become the core of your strategy with the right setup. This time, the goal of &quot;no useless cards&quot; is no longer an unattainable dream.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Newly Designed Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More like a calendar than a map, each run consists of four weeks, with seven days per week for you to spend as you wish. Will you battle day after day to find the perfect cards, or sleep through to the weekend to gain massive health boosts? The choice is entirely yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The End of the Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating the final boss, your adventure is far from over. Scared Gaol collects the card decks of all players who have cleared the game. You can choose any opponent to challenge, climb the leaderboard, and prove your strength.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4135930?t=1772952976","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/11b03323d61eab1e2c28ca969436a92ff76288b9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772952976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/451e03d93c0a6582bc2e59a21e292681842aa6a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772952976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/451e03d93c0a6582bc2e59a21e292681842aa6a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772952976","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4252320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ever-Changing Battles</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles take place on a 5x5 grid. Cards in varying positions and factions interact dynamically, creating a constantly shifting battlefield. Your opponents are meticulously designed computer programs with unparalleled intelligence, and you always have the chance to try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.poster.avif?t=1772952976\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.webm?t=1772952976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/09570a086c4ed9b1cbad094a3e101411.mp4?t=1772952976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.poster.avif?t=1772952976\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.webm?t=1772952976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/extras/3f0b97956130bdbf8f5bf325c42c5946.mp4?t=1772952976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards with Infinite Potential</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card not only possesses unique skills but also features three sticker slots that can be enhanced with new abilities through stickers. Even the most ordinary card can become the core of your strategy with the right setup. This time, the goal of &quot;no useless cards&quot; is no longer an unattainable dream.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Newly Designed Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More like a calendar than a map, each run consists of four weeks, with seven days per week for you to spend as you wish. Will you battle day after day to find the perfect cards, or sleep through to the weekend to gain massive health boosts? The choice is entirely yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The End of the Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating the final boss, your adventure is far from over. Scared Gaol collects the card decks of all players who have cleared the game. You can choose any opponent to challenge, climb the leaderboard, and prove your strength.</p>","developers":["\u773c\u955c\u788e\u4e86"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135930/6ec0c2e0926b7b02099f4be567b40d63bc52ca01/header.jpg?t=1772952976","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> all<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> all<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4135930/143480791/ce8cc6fa3f84f2c0463e094049e1d923fbed1923/1769073731/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769077516","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4135930/143480791/ce8cc6fa3f84f2c0463e094049e1d923fbed1923/1769073731/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769077516","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4135930/143480791/ce8cc6fa3f84f2c0463e094049e1d923fbed1923/1769073731/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769077516","id":257231385,"name":"Scared Crow PV1\uff08en\uff09","thumbnail":"https://